<blockquote>
<p>if CI self-identify themselves as The Resistance, then Ogun's blessing means that they will never be able to win too</p>
</blockquote>
<p>How so?</p>
<p>I don't think that they necessarily identify as The Resistance; it was Soglo's attempt to play on Ogun's perceived love of the under dog (see the Haitian Rebellion).</p>
<p>Also, this might be part one of a story arc about the CI and the impact of deals like these. Soglo wasn't the only one going on &quot;expeditions.&quot;</p>

