																		Quick basic French grammar lesson
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/azzleflux" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1444699); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1444699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609233382" alt="azzleflux" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1444699)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/azzleflux" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1444699); return false;" >azzleflux</a></span> <span class="odate time_1356671194 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">28 Dec 2012 05:06</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1672037">
									

<p><sub>Please note that I only have three years of high school French experience, so I could be wrong about this.</sub></p>
<p>In French, there are two second person pronouns; <em>tu</em> and <em>vous</em>. <em>Tu</em> is the way to informally say &quot;you&quot; to a single friend of someone you feel close enough to be comfortable with<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-974237-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-974237-1')">1</a></sup>. <em>Vous</em> is both the formal way to say &quot;you&quot; to someone<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-974237-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-974237-2')">2</a></sup> as well as the way to refer to multiple people<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-974237-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-974237-3')">3</a></sup>.</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-974237-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-974237-1')">1</a>. i.e. <em>Tu es mon ami</em>=You are my friend</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-974237-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-974237-2')">2</a>. i.e. <em>Vous etes mon professeur</em>=You are my teacher</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-974237-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-974237-3')">3</a>. i.e. <em>Vous etes mes amis</em>=You are my friends</div>
</div>

							</div>

								
					
